1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,222
All right, class. Who wants to demonstrate CPR?

2
00:00:04,872 --> 00:00:07,439
I can! I know this!

3
00:00:10,229 --> 00:00:15,884
(humming) First I was afraid… I was petrified…

4
00:00:15,934 --> 00:00:19,971
No, no, no! Wrong song! It's "Stayin' Alive"!

5
00:00:20,021 --> 00:00:22,453
Oh! Right! Right!

6
00:00:22,503 --> 00:00:27,125
Wait! You were in the parking lot earlier. THAT'S how I know you!

7
00:00:29,305 --> 00:00:44,528
(the class sings) Ah, ah, ah, ah — keep him alive, keep him alive! Hundred and ten, do it again! Push, push, push, push! Hey!

8
00:00:44,578 --> 00:00:47,417
OKAY! OKAY! STOP!

9
00:00:47,817 --> 00:00:55,817
You stopped compressions. You didn't keep 100 to 120 a minute. Nobody called 911.

10
00:00:55,867 --> 00:00:57,142
You lost him.

11
00:00:59,692 --> 00:01:04,586
Yep. He's dead. What do we do next? Christopher?

12
00:01:04,636 --> 00:01:06,797
I have no idea.

13
00:01:06,847 --> 00:01:08,086
Anyone else?

14
00:01:08,136 --> 00:01:11,632
Actually… we could bury him?

15
00:01:13,202 --> 00:01:17,263
Check for an organ-donor card. We've only got five minutes to harvest.
